Without Windows 10 systems being managed, devices could be rogue and become targets of an attacker."
          solution    : "Configure the Windows 10 system to use either Group Policy or an approved MDM product to enforce STIG compliance."
          reference   : "800-171|3.4.2,800-171r3|03.04.02a.,800-53|CM-6b.,800-53r5|CM-6b.,CCI|CCI-000366,CN-L3|8.1.10.6(d),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF2.0|DE.CM-09,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.9,ITSG-33|CM-6b.,LEVEL|2M,NESA|T3.2.1,Rule-ID|SV-268319r1081055_rule,STIG-ID|WN10-CC-000063,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-268319"
