Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> Windows Components >> File Explorer >> \'Configure Windows SmartScreen\'

to \'Enabled\'. (Selection options are not available.)

v1507 LTSB:Configure the policy value for

Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> Windows Components >> File Explorer >> \'Configure Windows SmartScreen\'

to \'Enabled\' with \'Require approval from an administrator before running downloaded unknown software\' selected.'
