    <custom_item>
      type        : REG_CHECK
      description : "1.25 WN10-00-000110"
      info        : "Simple TCP/IP Services must not be installed on the system.

GROUP ID: V-220720RULE ID: SV-220720r958478

Some protocols and services do not support required security features, such as encrypting passwords or traffic."
      solution    : 'Uninstall \'Simple TCPIP Services (i.e. echo, daytime etc)\' from the system.

Run \'Programs and Features\'.Select \'Turn Windows Features on or off\'.De-select \'Simple TCPIP Services (i.e. echo, daytime etc)\'.'
