          solution    : 'Configure the policy value for

Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> MS Security Guide >> \'Configure SMBv1 client driver\'

to \'Enabled\' with \'Disable driver (recommended)\' selected for \'Configure MrxSmb10 driver\'.

